# Changelog

All notable changes to **The Daily Grind Café** website are documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## [1.3.0] - 2026-10-30

### Added
- Meta descriptions on all five pages (Home, Menu, About Us, Contact, Enquiries) to improve how the site appears in search engine results.

## [1.2.0] - 2026-10-30

### Added
- Search bar on the Home and Menu pages that filters items as you type by name or description.
- Result message under the search bar ("Showing 1 of 7 items" or "No items found").
- Menu sections such as "Hot Beverages" now hide automatically when none of their items match the search.

## [1.1.0] - 2026-10-30

### Added
- Click-to-enlarge picture viewer (lightbox) on the Home and Menu pages.
- Pictures open in a pop-up with the item name as a caption.
- The viewer closes by clicking the dark background, using the close button, or pressing Esc.
- Hover effect on pictures and keyboard support (Tab, then Enter or Space) to open them.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-10-30

### Added
- Initial release of the multi-page website: Home, Menu, About Us, Contact and Enquiries.
- Shared stylesheet (`Assets/style.css`) using a forest green, warm cream and espresso brown palette.
- Navigation bar with the current page highlighted.
- Menu ordering: add items, change quantities, see the running total, then place or clear the order (saved in the browser).
- Form validation on the Contact and Enquiry forms with clear error messages.
